# Raw LuST dataset (third-party, ~400 MB of SUMO route/network XML). Download
# from the LuST source (see Lust_dataset/README.md, Lust_dataset/Citations.bib).
# Paper results reproduce from the committed caches simulation/lust_roi_trajectories*.npz;
# the raw data is only needed to regenerate those caches via build_lust_24h.py.
Lust_dataset/scenario/
Lust_dataset/misc/

# Resume checkpoints for long sweeps. Machine-local by design: the checkpoint key
# records config_hash/seeds/budget but NOT library versions, so a checkpoint shipped
# to another machine would be silently reused there and mix points computed under
# different numpy/pennylane builds into a single figure. Always recompute per machine
# (or pin versions exactly and opt in by hand).
simulation/depth_sweep_points.json
